+From: Felix Fietkau <nbd@nbd.name>
+Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 04:00:57 +0200
+Subject: [PATCH] wifi: mac80211: compute the links of each AP VLAN on its own
+
+ieee80211_update_apvlan_links() narrows one link mask for every
+4-address AP VLAN of the AP with the links of that VLAN's station, and
+never resets it between VLANs. Each VLAN after the first thus gets only
+the links that the stations of all earlier VLANs hold as well. A link
+change of an AP with two WDS MLD stations on different link sets takes
+links from the second VLAN that its station uses. Reachable via
+ieee80211_vif_update_links() on an AP link add or removal.
+
+Start from the links of the AP for each VLAN.
+
+Fixes: 469d5d5a3b7a ("wifi: mac80211: synchronize valid links for WDS AP_VLAN interfaces")
+Signed-off-by: Felix Fietkau <nbd@nbd.name>
+
