+Subject: [PATCH 1/6] wifi: mt76: mt7915: preserve 64-bit TWT intervals
+
+The peer-controlled mantissa and exponent can produce an interval larger
+than U32_MAX. div_u64_rem takes a u32 divisor and can truncate this value
+to zero or schedule the agreement using an incorrect remainder. Use the
+64-bit divisor/remainder helper and reject zero intervals explicitly.
+
